#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The Hijrah: a journey in stages"
msgstr "Hijrah: tafiya mataki-mataki"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "English working draft; no final narration or translation approved"
msgstr "Tsarin aiki na Turanci; babu tabbataccen labari ko fassarar da aka amince da ita"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Connect preparations, the stay at Thawr, the onward journey, and arrival while distinguishing an illustration from its evidence."
msgstr "Haɗa shirye-shirye, zama a Thawr, ci gaba da tafiya, da isowa yayin da kake rabe tsakanir hoto da hujjarsa."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#: src/lib/guide-provider.js
#, ai
msgid "How did the journey continue after the cave?"
msgstr "Yaya aka ci gaba da tafiyar bayan barin kogon?"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#: src/lib/guide-provider.js
#, ai
msgid "Show the onward journey"
msgstr "Nuna ci gaba da tafiyar"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Before the journey"
msgstr "Kafin tafiyar"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "This chapter follows the Hijrah: the Prophet Muhammad’s ﷺ migration from Makkah to Madinah. We will follow a few connected stages, from preparations for departure to arrival in Madinah."
msgstr "Wannan babin yana bin diddigin Hijrah ne: hijirar Annabi Muhammadu ﷺ daga Makkah zuwa Madinah. Za mu bi wasu matakai masu alaƙa da juna, tun daga shirye-shiryen tashi har zuwa isowa Madinah."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Before the Prophet departed, some Muslims had already moved to Madinah. Abu Bakr was preparing to leave too, but waited to accompany him. This was part of a wider movement, not a departure in which everyone travelled together."
msgstr "Kafin Annabi ya tashi, wasu Musulmi sun riga sun koma Madinah. Abu Bakr ma yana shirin tafiya, amma ya jira domin su tafi tare. Wannan ya kasance wani ɓangare na ƙaura mafi girma, ba wai tashi da kowa ya yi tafiya tare ba."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Preparing to leave"
msgstr "Shirin tashi"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "When permission to depart had been given, preparations were made for the Prophet ﷺ and Abu Bakr. ‘Aishah’s account describes provisions packed in a bag. Asma, Abu Bakr’s daughter, used part of her waist-belt to tie its opening."
msgstr "Lokacin da aka ba da izinin tashi, an yi shirye-shirye domin Annabi ﷺ da Abu Bakr. Bayanin ‘Aishah ya bayyana guzuri da aka haɗa a jaka. Asma, ɗiyar Abu Bakr, ta yi amfani da ɓangaren ɗaurin gindinta wajen ɗure bakin jakar."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "They also hired a skilled guide, entrusted him with two riding animals, and arranged to meet him at Thawr after three nights. The arrangements for the onward journey were already being made."
msgstr "Haka kuma sun ɗauki gogaggen jagora, suka amintar da shi da dabbobin hawa guda biyu, kuma suka tsara saduwa da shi a Thawr bayan darare uku. An riga an yi shirye-shiryen ci gaba da tafiyar."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Three nights at Thawr"
msgstr "Darare uku a Thawr"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "After the preparations, the Prophet ﷺ and Abu Bakr sheltered in a cave on Mount Thawr. ‘Aishah’s account in Sahih al-Bukhari records that they stayed there for three nights. This was a stage within the journey, not its destination."
msgstr "Bayan shirye-shiryen, Annabi ﷺ da Abu Bakr sun fake a wani kogo a Dutsen Thawr. Bayanin ‘Aishah a cikin Sahih al-Bukhari ya nuna cewa sun zauna a can na tsawon darare uku. Wannan ya kasance mataki ne a cikin tafiyar, ba wai inda za su ba."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "During the stay, ‘Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr brought news of plans against them. He came after darkness and left before daybreak, returning to Makkah. His contribution was information."
msgstr "Lokacin suna can, ‘Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr yana kawo musu labaran shirye-shiryen da ake yi a kansu. Yana zuwa bayan duhu ya yi, sannan ya tafi kafin gari ya waye, ya koma Makkah. Gudunmawar da ya bayar ita ce kawo labari."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Abu Bakr’s own account brings us closer to the danger of discovery. He was concerned that they might be seen if someone looked down. The Prophet reassured him."
msgstr "Bayanin Abu Bakr da kansa ya nuna mana kusancin haɗarin gano su. Ya damu cewa za a iya ganinsu idan wani ya duba ƙasa. Annabi ya kwantar masa da hankali."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The Quran also recalls the two in the cave and the reassurance given to the companion. Ibn Kathir’s commentary on the passage explains the reassurance through Allah’s help and support."
msgstr "Alkur'ani kuma ya ambaci mutane biyun a cikin kogon da kuma kwantar da hankalin da aka yi wa abokin tafiyar. Bayanin Ibn Kathir a kan wannan nassi ya bayyana kwantar da hankalin ta hanyar taimako da tallafi na Allah."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The journey continues"
msgstr "An ci gaba da tafiya"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The arranged meeting with the guide connects the stay at Thawr to the next stage. When the Prophet ﷺ and Abu Bakr continued, ‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah and the guide went with them. The account says that the guide led them by the coastal way."
msgstr "Saduwar da aka tsara da jagoran ta haɗa zaman Thawr da mataki na gaba. Lokacin da Annabi ﷺ da Abu Bakr suka ci gaba da tafiya, ‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah da jagoran sun tafi tare da su. Bayanin ya ce jagoran ya bi da su ta hanyar teku."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "That description gives us part of the route’s character, but not every turn or stopping place. The connection shown here is schematic; it is not a measured itinerary."
msgstr "Wannan bayanin yana ba mu wani ɓangare na yanayin hanyar, amma ba kowane karkataccen wuri ko wurin tsayawa ba. Haɗin da aka nuna a nan zane ne kawai; ba cikakken taswirar hanya ba ne."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Arrival and a new beginning"
msgstr "Isowa da sabon mafari"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "In Madinah, Muslims went out to wait after hearing that the Prophet ﷺ had left Makkah. The arrival account describes their reception of him and his stay among Bani ‘Amr ibn ‘Awf."
msgstr "A Madinah, Musulmi sun fito suna jira bayan sun ji cewa Annabi ﷺ ya bar Makkah. Bayanin isowar ya bayyana yadda aka karɓe shi da kuma zamansa a tsakanin Bani ‘Amr ibn ‘Awf."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The account goes on to describe a date-drying yard that became the site of the Prophet’s mosque in Madinah. It records the Prophet carrying bricks with those building it."
msgstr "Bayanin ya ci gaba da bayyana wurin shanya dabino wanda ya zama mazaunin masallacin Annabi a Madinah. Ya nuna Annabi yana ɗaukar tubali tare da waɗanda suke gina shi."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "You followed preparations, a period of shelter, the onward journey, and arrival. You met different forms of help and read accounts of reassurance. This is a selected account, not a complete history of every episode or consequence of the Hijrah."
msgstr "Kun bi diddigin shirye-shirye, lokacin fake wa, ci gaba da tafiya, da isowa. Kun ga hanyoyi daban-daban na taimako kuma kun karanta bayanai na kwantar da hankali. Wannan zaɓaɓɓen bayani ne, ba cikakken tarihin kowane sashe ko sakamakon Hijrah ba."

