#, ai
msgid "Sahih al-Bukhari"
msgstr "Sahih al-Bukhari"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Some Muslims moved to Madinah before this departure; the selected passage also describes Abu Bakr waiting to accompany the Prophet ﷺ."
msgstr "Wasu Musulmi sun koma Madinah kafin wannan tafiyar; zaɓaɓɓen nassin ya kuma bayyana Abu Bakr yana jiran ya raka Annabi ﷺ."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The selected passage describes provisions and Asma bint Abi Bakr using part of her waist-belt to tie the bag."
msgstr "Zaɓaɓɓen nassin ya bayyana guzuri da kuma yadda Asma bint Abi Bakr ta yi amfani da ɓangaren ɗaurin gindinta wajen ɗure jakar."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The selected passage supports the cave on Mount Thawr and three nights."
msgstr "Zaɓaɓɓen nassin yana tabbatar da kogon Dutsen Thawr da darare uku."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "It does not establish coordinates, dimensions, or the exact arrangement of a visual model."
msgstr "Ba ya tabbatar da daidaitattun wurare, girma, ko ainihin tsarin fasalin hoto."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The selected passage describes ‘Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr bringing news of plans against the two companions after darkness."
msgstr "Nassin da aka zaɓa yana bayyana yadda ‘Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr yake kawo musu labaran shirye-shiryen da ake yi da su bayan duhu ya yi."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "It does not establish modern clock times or a mapped trail."
msgstr "Ba ya nuna lokutan agogo na zamani ko kuma taswirar hanya da aka zana."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The selected passage connects ‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah with tending sheep and making milk available during the three nights."
msgstr "Nassin da aka zaɓa yana haɗa ‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah da kiwon tumaki da kuma samar da madara a cikin darare ukun nan."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The selected passage describes hiring a skilled guide, entrusting him with two riding animals, and arranging the meeting at Thawr."
msgstr "Nassin da aka zaɓa yana bayyana ɗaukar gogaggun jagora aiki, da amince masa da dabbobin hawa guda biyu, da kuma tsara haɗuwa a Thawr."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The selected passage does not supply the guide’s personal name or a precise route."
msgstr "Nassin da aka zaɓa bai ambaci sunan jagoran ba ko kuma takamaiman hanyar da aka bi."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The selected passage says that ‘Amir and the guide went with them and that the guide led them by the coastal way."
msgstr "Nassin da aka zaɓa ya nuna cewa ‘Amir da jagoran sun tafi tare da su, kuma jagoran ya bi da su ta hanyar gabar teku."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "It does not establish every turn, distance, stopping place, or exact GPS route."
msgstr "Ba ya nuna kowane karkataccen wuri, nisa, wurin tsayawa, ko takamaiman hanyar GPS."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Abu Bakr’s account records concern about being seen and the Prophet’s reassurance."
msgstr "Rawayar Abu Bakr ta nuna fargabar kada a gan su da kuma kwantar da hankali da Annabi ya yi masa."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#: src/content/lenses.js
#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Quran"
msgstr "Alkur'ani"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The selected extract recalls the two in the cave and the reassurance to the companion."
msgstr "Wannan sashe da aka zaɓa yana tunatar da mu game da mutane biyun da ke cikin kogon da kuma kwantar da hankalin da aka yi wa abokin tafiyar."

