msgstr "Hujjojin da aka zaɓa ba su nuna takamaiman hanya ba. Suna bayyana hanyar gabar teku ne kawai, yayin da wannan bayyani na zane ne kawai ba wai cikakkiyar taswirar hanya ba."

#: src/lib/guide-provider.js
#, ai
msgid "They hired a skilled guide, entrusted him with two riding animals, and arranged to meet him at Thawr. The account says he led them by the coastal way."
msgstr "Sun ɗauki gogaggen jagora aiki, suka amince masa da dabbobin hawa guda biyu, kuma suka tsara haɗuwa da shi a Thawr. Rawayar ta ce ya bi da su ta hanyar gabar teku."

#: src/lib/guide-provider.js
