msgid "The selected account says that they remained in the cave for three nights."
msgstr "Rawayar da aka zaɓa ta ce sun zauna a cikin kogon har tsawon darare uku."

#: src/lib/guide-provider.js
#, ai
msgid "The preparations account describes provisions packed in a bag and Asma bint Abi Bakr using part of her waist-belt to tie its opening."
msgstr "Rawayar shirye-shiryen tana bayyana yadda aka zuba guzuri a cikin jaka da kuma yadda Asma bint Abi Bakr ta yi amfani da sashin ɗaurin gindinta don ɗure bakin jakar."

#: src/lib/guide-provider.js
#, ai
msgid "The arrival account describes Muslims waiting, the stay among Bani ‘Amr ibn ‘Awf, and later building work at the mosque site."
msgstr "Rawayar isarwa tana bayyana yadda Musulmai suke jira, zaman da aka yi a tsakanin Bani ‘Amr ibn ‘Awf, da kuma aikin ginin masallaci da aka yi daga baya."

#: src/lib/guide-provider.js
