msgid "Follow the migration from Makkah to Madinah stage by stage, with every paragraph linked to the passage it rests on."
msgstr "Bi hijirar daga Makkah zuwa Madinah mataki-mataki, tare da kowane sakin layi yana da alaƙa da nassin da ya dogara a kansa."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "A rider on the road"
msgstr "Wani mahayi a kan hanya"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Quraysh had offered a reward for each of the two travellers. Suraqah ibn Malik recounts that a man came to his gathering and said he had just seen figures near the coast. Suraqah recognised who they must be, and set out after them."
msgstr "Quraysh sun yi alkawarin ba da lada ga kowane ɗayan matafiyan biyu. Suraqah ibn Malik ya ba da labarin cewa wani mutum ya zo wurin taron su ya ce yanzu haka ya ga wasu mutane kusa da gaɓar teku. Suraqah ya gane ko su wane ne, sai ya nufi bayansu."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "By his own account, he came close enough to hear the Prophet ﷺ reciting. Then the forelegs of his horse sank into the ground up to the knees, and he was thrown from it."
msgstr "A cikin bayaninsa, ya kusanci kusa sosai har ya ji Annabi ﷺ yana karatu. Sai kafafun gaba na dokinsa suka nutse a cikin ƙasa har zuwa gwiwoyi, kuma ya faɗi daga kansa."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "He told them what Quraysh intended and offered them provisions. They took nothing from him and asked only that he keep their news hidden. At his request, ‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah wrote him a guarantee of safety on a piece of leather. Then they went on."
msgstr "Ya gaya musu abin da Quraysh suka yi niyya kuma ya ba su guzuri. Ba su karɓi komai daga gare shi ba kuma sun nemi kawai ya ɓoye labarinsu. Bayan ya nema, ‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah ya rubuta masa takardar tsira a kan wani yanki na fata. Bayan haka suka ci gaba da tafiya."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Quba: the first stop"
msgstr "Quba: tasha ta farko"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "He stayed among them for more than ten nights. There he founded the mosque that the account calls the one founded on piety, and he prayed in it."
msgstr "Ya zauna a cikinsu fiye da darare goma. A can ya kafa masallacin da bayanin ya kira wanda aka kafa shi a kan takawa, kuma ya yi sallah a cikinsa."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Then he rode on, with people walking beside him, until his camel knelt at a place in Madinah where some of the Muslims already prayed. It was a yard for drying dates."
msgstr "Bayan haka ya hau abin hawa ya ci gaba da tafiya, tare da mutane suna tafiya a gefensa, har sai da raƙuminsa ya durƙusa a wani wuri a Madinah inda wasu daga cikin musulmi suka riga suna sallah. Wurin ya kasance filin shanyar dabino."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Suraqah’s account records the reward offered for each of the two, and a report that figures had been seen near the coast."
msgstr "Bayanin Suraqah ya rubuta ladan da aka yi alkawari ga kowane ɗayan biyun, da kuma rahoton cewa an ga wasu mutane kusa da gaɓar teku."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "It does not establish where on the route this happened, and the scene does not place it."
msgstr "Ba ta bayyana a ina ne hakan ya faru a kan hanyar ba, kuma hoton bai nuna wurin ba."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Suraqah describes the forelegs of his horse sinking into the ground to the knees, and being thrown."
msgstr "Suraqah ya bayyana yadda kafafun gaba na dokinsa suka nutse a cikin kasa har zuwa gwiwoyi, kuma aka kada shi."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "This is his own first-person account. The scene shows the road, not the event or any person."
msgstr "Wannan shi ne bayanin da ya bayar da kansa. Hoton yana nuna hanyar ne, ba wai faruwar lamarin ko wani mutum ba."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "They asked only that he keep their news hidden; ‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah wrote him a guarantee of safety."
msgstr "Ba su nema daga gare shi ba face ya boye labarinsu; kuma 'Amir ibn Fuhayrah ya rubuta masa takardar amana."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The wording of the written guarantee is not given in this passage."
msgstr "Ba a fadi lafazin takardar amanar ba a cikin wannan nassin."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The account gives a stay of more than ten nights among Bani ‘Amr ibn ‘Awf and the founding of a mosque there."
msgstr "Bayanin ya ambaci zama na tsawon daruruwa fiye da goma a tsakanin Bani 'Amr ibn 'Awf da kuma gina masallaci a can."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "He rode on with people walking beside him until his camel knelt at the site of the mosque in Madinah."
msgstr "Ya hau abun hawa ya tafi yayin da mutane ke tafiya a gefensa har sai da rakumarsa ta durkusa a daidai wurin da masallacin yake a Madinah."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "It does not establish the route taken through the town or the appearance of the place."
msgstr "Ba ta bayyana hanyar da aka bi ta cikin garin ba ko kuma yadda wurin yake a bayyane."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "<0>Play</0> walks the chapter stage by stage with AI-generated narration."
msgstr "<0>Kunna</0> yana biye da matakan babin mataki-mataki tare da bayanin murya da OpenAI ta samar."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "<0>Play</0> walks the chapter stage by stage. The captions keep time over a quiet wind."
msgstr "<0>Kunna</0> yana biye da matakan babin mataki-mataki. Rubutun bayani yana tafiya daidai da lokaci cikin sautin iska mai sanyaya rai."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "<0>Ask</0> uses the chapter’s context to research in Turath and answer with source citations."
msgstr "<0>Tambaya</0> tana amfani da mahallin babin don yin bincike a cikin Turath da kuma ba da amsa tare da ambaton tushen bayanai."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "This excerpt does not give an exact departure date."
msgstr "Wannan tsakuren bai bayyana takamaiman ranar tashi ba."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The excerpt describes preparations, not a nightly delivery to the cave."
msgstr "Tsakuren yana bayyana shirye-shirye ne, ba wai kai kaya kowane dare zuwa kogon ba."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The excerpt does not describe erasing footprints."
msgstr "Tsakuren bai bayyana goge sawun kafa ba."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The account does not describe the cave’s dimensions or layout."
msgstr "Bayanin bai bayyana girman kogon ko tsarin cikinsa ba."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "This excerpt is not the full verse and does not itself name Abu Bakr or Mount Thawr."
msgstr "Wannan tsakuren ba shi ne cikakken ayar ba, kuma shi kansa bai ambaci sunan Abu Bakr ko Dutsen Thawr ba."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "This is Ibn Kathir’s commentary, not the Quranic wording itself."
msgstr "Wannan shi ne tafsirin Ibn Kathir, ba wai lafazin Alkur'ani da kansa ba."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "It does not give an exact location for the stay among Bani ‘Amr ibn ‘Awf."
msgstr "Bai bayyana takamaiman wurin da aka zauna ba a tsakanin Bani 'Amr ibn 'Awf."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The passage does not name the place; identifying it as Quba rests on other reports."
msgstr "Nassin bai ambaci sunan wurin ba; gano cewa Quba ne ya dogara ne a kan wasu ruwayoyin daban."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The night of departure"
msgstr "Daren tashi"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The leaders of Quraysh met in Dar al-Nadwah, the house where they settled their affairs, to decide what to do about the Prophet ﷺ now that they feared him."
msgstr "Shugabannin Quraysh sun taru a Dar al-Nadwah, gidan da suke yanke shawarwarin al'amuransu, domin su yanke shawarar abin da za su yi game da Annabi ﷺ tun da yanzu suna tsoronsa."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "That night they gathered at his door, waiting for him to sleep. He told ‘Ali to lie in his bed, wrapped in his green cloak, and assured him that no harm from them would reach him."
msgstr "A wannan daren suka taru a kofar gidansa, suna jiran ya yi barci. Ya gaya wa 'Ali ya kwanta a gadonsa, ya lullube da koren mayafinsa, kuma ya tabbatar masa da cewa babu wata cutarwa da za ta same shi daga gare su."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "‘Ali stayed behind for another reason too. People in Makkah left their valuables with the Prophet ﷺ for safekeeping, because they knew his honesty. ‘Ali was to return every one of them."
msgstr "'Ali ya tsaya a baya saboda wani dalili na daban kuma. Mutane a Makkah suna barin kayayyakinsu masu daraja a wurin Annabi ﷺ don tsare musu, saboda sun san gaskiyarsa. 'Ali zai mayar da kowane guda daga cikinsu ga masu shi."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The tent of Umm Ma‘bad"
msgstr "Tandun Umm Ma'bad"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Further on they stopped at the tent of Umm Ma‘bad of Khuza‘ah and asked for hospitality. She had no food to offer, she said, and no ewe but one that gave no milk."
msgstr "Gaba kadan suka tsaya a tantin Umm Ma'bad ta kabilar Khuza'ah suka nemi a saukar da su. Ta ce ba ta da abincin da za ta ba su, kuma ba ta da ko da tunkiya daya face wadda ba ta da madara."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The Prophet ﷺ called for the ewe, passed his hand over its udder and called on Allah. He milked it into a large vessel until it frothed, and said: drink, Umm Ma‘bad. Ibn Kathir notes that her story is well known and comes through routes that strengthen one another."
msgstr "Annabi ﷺ ya nemi a kawo tunkiyar, ya shafa hannunsa a kan nononta kuma ya roki Allah. Ya tatse madararta a cikin wani babban kwano har sai da ta yi kumfa, ya ce: sha, Umm Ma'bad. Ibn Kathir ya bayyana cewa labarinta sananne ne kuma ya zo ta hanyoyi daban-daban da ke karfafa juna."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Ibn Ishaq reports that Quraysh met in Dar al-Nadwah to consult about the Prophet ﷺ once they feared him."
msgstr "Ibn Ishaq ya ruwaito cewa Quraysh sun taru a Dar al-Nadwah domin su yi shawara game da Annabi ﷺ lokacin da suka ji tsoronsa."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The excerpt covers the meeting, not what was said in it."
msgstr "Tsakuren ya shafi taron ne, ba wai abin da aka fada a cikinsa ba."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "They gathered at his door at night; he told ‘Ali to sleep in his bed under his green cloak and assured him of safety."
msgstr "Suka taru a kofarsa da daddare; ya gaya wa 'Ali ya kwanta a gadonsa a karkashin koren mayafinsa kuma ya tabbatar masa da tsira."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Ibn Kathir notes that al-Waqidi also relates this, combining several narrators’ accounts."
msgstr "Ibn Kathir ya bayyana cewa al-Waqidi ma ya ruwaito wannan, inda ya hada bayanan masu ruwaye da yawa."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Ibn Ishaq introduces this with “as it has reached me”."
msgstr "Ibn Ishaq ya gabatar da wannan da kalmar \"kamar yadda ya zo mini\"."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "They stopped at Umm Ma‘bad’s tent; she had only a ewe without milk, which then gave milk in abundance."
msgstr "Suka tsaya a tantin Umm Ma'bad; ba ta da komai face tunkiya marar madara, wadda daga baya ta ba da madara mai yawa."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Ibn Kathir calls the story well known, through routes that support one another. It does not fix where the tent stood."
msgstr "Ibn Kathir ya kira labarin da sananne, ta hanyoyin da ke tallafawa juna. Bai kayyade inda tantin yake ba."

#: src/content/details.js
#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Al-Rahiq al-Makhtum"
msgstr "Al-Rahiq al-Makhtum"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "The noon visit"
msgstr "Ziyarar tsakar rana"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "At the height of noon, an hour at which he never used to come, the Prophet ﷺ arrived at Abu Bakr’s house with his face covered. He said he had been given permission to leave. Abu Bakr asked to go with him, and he said yes."
msgstr "A lokacin tsananin zafin rana, sa'ar da bai taba zuwa ba, Annabi ﷺ ya isa gidan Abu Bakr fuskarsa a rufe. Ya ce an ba shi izinin fita. Abu Bakr ya nemi ya raka shi, sai ya ce eh."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "This is ‘Aishah’s account as quoted in a modern sirah. The position of the house is illustrative."
msgstr "Wannan shi ne bayanin da aka ruwaito daga 'A'ishah a cikin littafin sirah na zamani. Matsayin gidan na kiyasi ne."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "Stones in the niche"
msgstr "Duwatsu a cikin rami"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "Abu Bakr took all his money with him, five or six thousand dirhams. Asma recounts that her blind grandfather feared the family had been left with nothing. She put stones where the money used to be kept, covered them with a cloth, and guided his hand to them so that he would be at ease."
msgstr "Abu Bakr ya tafi da dukkan dukiyarsa, dirhami dubu biyar ko shida. Asma'u ta ba da labarin cewa makahon kakanta ya ji tsoron kada a bar iyalin ba tare da komai ba. Ta sanya duwatsu a inda aka saba ajiye kudin, ta rufe su da tufa, sannan ta kai hannunsa zuwa gare su domin ya natsu."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "Reported by Ibn Ishaq from Asma through her grandson. The position of the house is illustrative."
msgstr "Ibn Ishaq ne ya ruwaito shi daga Asma'u ta hannun jikanta. Matsayin gidan na kiyasi ne."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "Why south?"
msgstr "Me yasa kudu?"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "Madinah lies to the north, and that is where a search would begin. They left in the opposite direction, on the road towards Yemen, for about five miles to Mount Thawr."
msgstr "Madinah tana arewa ne, kuma a can ne za a fara bincike. Sai suka nufi kishiyar hanya, a kan hanyar da ta nufi Yemen, kusan mil biyar zuwa Dutsen Thawr."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "This is a modern author’s reading of the route, not wording from an early report."
msgstr "Wannan fahimtar marubuci ne na zamani game da hanyar, ba lafazin da ya fito daga tsohuwar ruwaya ba."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "She of the two belts"
msgstr "Mai dambala biyu"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "When the three nights had passed, Asma brought their provisions but had forgotten a strap to hang the bag. She undid her waist-belt and used it. For that she was called Dhat al-Nitaqayn, she of the two belts."
msgstr "Bayan kwanaki uku sun shude, Asma'u ta kawo musu guzuri amma ta manta igiyar da za ta rataye buhun. Sai ta kwance dambalarta ta yi amfani da ita. Saboda haka aka kira ta Dhat al-Nitaqayn, wato mai dambala biyu."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "Ibn Ishaq’s report. ‘Aishah’s account in al-Bukhari places the belt at the packing of the provisions instead."
msgstr "Ruwayar Ibn Ishaq. Bayanin 'A'ishah a cikin al-Bukhari ya sanya dambalar a lokacin hada guzuriyar ne maimakon haka."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "The spider’s web"
msgstr "Sakar gizo-gizo"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "One report says the pursuers climbed the mountain, passed the cave, and saw a spider’s web across its opening. No one could have gone in, they reasoned, and they moved on. Ibn Kathir calls its chain good, the best of what is reported on this. The scene does not draw the web."
msgstr "Wata ruwaya ta ce masu bin sawu sun hau dutsen, sun wuce kogon, sai suka ga sakar gizo-gizo a kofar shigarsa. Sun yi tunanin cewa babu wanda zai iya shiga, sai suka wuce. Ibn Kathir ya kira isnadinta da mai kyau, mafi kyau a cikin abin da aka ruwaito a kan haka. Hoton bai zana sakar gizo-gizon ba."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "A single report. The nesting doves of popular retellings are not part of it."
msgstr "Ruwaya guda daya ce. Kurciyoyin da ke yin sheka a cikin labaran da mutane suka saba ji ba sa cikin wannan ruwayar."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "The stations of the road"
msgstr "Tashoshin hanya"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "Ibn Ishaq names the way the guide took: below Makkah, along the coast, across the road below ‘Usfan, below Amaj, past Qudayd, then al-Kharrar, Thaniyyat al-Marah, Liqf and on. Many of these names are hard to place today, so the line drawn here stays approximate."
msgstr "Ibn Ishaq ya ambaci hanyar da jagoran ya bi: ta karkashin Makkah, ta gefen teku, ta ratsa hanyar karkashin 'Usfan, karkashin Amaj, ta wuce Qudayd, sannan al-Kharrar, Thaniyyat al-Marah, Liqf da sauran su. Da yawa daga cikin wadannan sunaye suna da wuyar tantance inda suke a yau, saboda haka layin da aka zana a nan na kiyasi ne."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "A list of names, without distances or days."
msgstr "Jerin sunaye ne, ba tare da nisa ko kwanaki ba."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "White garments"
msgstr "Fararen tufafi"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "On the way they met al-Zubayr with a group of Muslim merchants returning from Syria. He gave the Prophet ﷺ and Abu Bakr white garments to wear."
msgstr "A kan hanya sun hadu da al-Zubayr tare da gungun 'yan kasuwa musulmi da ke dawowa daga Sham. Ya ba Annabi ﷺ da Abu Bakr fararen tufafi domin su sanya."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "From al-Bukhari, as quoted by Ibn Kathir. The account does not say where on the road they met."
msgstr "Daga al-Bukhari, kamar yadda Ibn Kathir ya ruwaito. Bayanin bai fadi a ina ne a kan hanyar suka hadu ba."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "The first Friday"
msgstr "Juma'a ta farko"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "After leaving Quba, the time for Friday prayer came while he was among Banu Salim ibn ‘Awf. He led it there, in the mosque in the bed of the valley, with about a hundred men."
msgstr "Bayan ya bar Quba, lokacin sallar Juma'a ya yi yana tsakanin Banu Salim ibn 'Awf. Ya jagoranci sallar a can, a masallacin da ke tsakiyar kwarin, tare da maza kusan dari."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "Quoted from a modern sirah, which cites Ibn Hisham. The position is illustrative."
msgstr "An samo shi ne daga littafin sirah na zamani, wanda ya ambato Ibn Hisham. Matsayin na kiyasi ne."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "Let her go"
msgstr "Ku kyale ta"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "Clan after clan took hold of his camel’s rope and invited him to stay with them. Each time he answered: let her go, for she is under command. She walked on until she knelt in the quarter of Banu Malik ibn al-Najjar."
msgstr "Dangi bayan dangi suka rika kama igiyar rakuminsa suna gayyatarsa ya sauka a wurinsu. A kowane lokaci yana amsa musu da cewa: ku kyale ta, domin tana karkashin umarni ne. Ta ci gaba da tafiya har sai da ta durkusa a unguwar Banu Malik ibn al-Najjar."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "Ibn Ishaq’s report. Her path through the town is not known."
msgstr "Ruwayar Ibn Ishaq. Ba a san hanyar da ta bi ta cikin garin ba."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "The house of Abu Ayyub"
msgstr "Gidan Abu Ayyub"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "He stayed in the house of Abu Ayyub until his mosque and his rooms were built, and he worked on the building himself alongside the Muhajirun and the Ansar."
msgstr "Ya zauna a gidan Abu Ayyub har sai da aka gina masallacinsa da dakunansa, kuma ya yi aiki a ginin da kansa tare da Muhajirun da Ansar."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "The house is placed beside the mosque site for illustration."
msgstr "An sanya gidan kusa da filin masallacin ne domin bayani."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "Brothers"
msgstr "Yan'uwantaka"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "He paired those who had migrated with those who received them, as brothers, so that each newcomer had someone to lean on."
msgstr "Ya hada wadanda suka yi hijira da wadanda suka karbe su a matsayin 'yan'uwa, domin kowane bako ya sami wanda zai dogara gare shi."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "This is Ibn Kathir’s chapter heading. The individual pairings are listed in the pages that follow it."
msgstr "Wannan shi ne kan babi na Ibn Kathir. An jera takamaiman hadakar mutanen a shafukan da ke biye da shi."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "The full moon has risen"
msgstr "Tala'al badru 'alayna"

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "A well-known report says the women and children sang “The full moon has risen upon us, from the passes of al-Wada‘” when he arrived. Al-Bayhaqi relates it from Ibn ‘Aishah, a later narrator, not from someone who was there."
msgstr "Wani sanannen rahoto ya ce mata da yara sun rera waƙar ‘Tala’al badru ‘alayna, min saniyyatil-wada‘’ sa’ilin da ya iso. Al-Bayhaqi ya ruwaito shi daga Ibn ‘Aishah, wanda maruwaiti ne na baya, ba daga wanda ya halarci taron ba."

#: src/content/details.js
#, ai
msgid "The chain stops short of an eyewitness, and some place the song at a later return to Madinah, not at this arrival."
msgstr "Sarkar ruwayar ba ta kai ga wanda ya shaida da idonsa ba, kuma wasu suna ganin an rera waƙar ne a lokacin da ya dawo Madinah daga baya, ba a wannan isowar ba."

