#, ai
msgid "The Quran"
msgstr "Alkur'ani"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Hadith collections"
msgstr "Tarin Hadisai"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Classical sirah and history"
msgstr "Sira da tarihin gargajiya"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Modern authors"
msgstr "Marubuta na zamani"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Evidence on the map"
msgstr "Hujjoji a kan taswira"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Each point of light is a passage this chapter cites, placed where it speaks of. Select one to read it."
msgstr "Kowane haske yana wakiltar nassin da aka ambata a wannan babin, an sanya shi a daidai inda yake magana a kai. Zaɓi ɗaya don karantawa."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "This is the story of the Hijrah: when the Prophet Muhammad ﷺ travelled from Makkah to Madinah, a new home."
msgstr "Wannan shi ne labarin Hijrah: lokacin da Annabi Muhammadu ﷺ ya yi hijira daga Makkah zuwa Madinah, sabon gida."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Many Muslims had already gone ahead. His best friend, Abu Bakr, waited so that they could travel together."
msgstr "Musulmai da yawa sun riga sun tafi. Abokinsa na gari, Abu Bakr, ya jira domin su yi tafiyar tare."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The Prophet ﷺ and Abu Bakr hid in a cave on Mount Thawr for three nights."
msgstr "Annabi ﷺ da Abu Bakr sun boye a cikin kogon dutsen Thawr na tsawon dare uku."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Each night, Abu Bakr’s son ‘Abdullah came in the dark to tell them the news from Makkah."
msgstr "Kowane dare, dan Abu Bakr mai suna 'Abdullah yakan zo cikin duhu domin ya gaya musu labaran da ke faruwa a Makkah."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A shepherd called ‘Amir brought his sheep close every evening, so that they had milk to drink."
msgstr "Wani makiyayi mai suna 'Amir yakan kawo tumakinsa kusa da su kowace maraice, domin su sami madara su sha."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Abu Bakr was worried: if someone looked down, they would be seen! The Prophet ﷺ calmed him."
msgstr "Abu Bakr ya damu: idan wani ya duba kasa, za a gan su! Annabi ﷺ ya kwantar masa da hankali."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The Quran remembers what the Prophet ﷺ said to his friend in the cave: do not be sad, Allah is with us."
msgstr "Alkur'ani ya ambaci abin da Annabi ﷺ ya gaya wa abokinsa a cikin kogon: kada ka damu, lallai Allah yana tare da mu."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Quraysh offered a big reward to catch them. A rider called Suraqah raced after them on his horse."
msgstr "Quraysh sun yi alkawarin babbar kyauta ga wanda ya kama su. Wani mai doki mai suna Suraqah ya biyo bayansu da sauri a kan dokinsa."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "As he came close, his horse’s legs sank into the ground, and he fell off!"
msgstr "Yayin da ya kusanto, kafafun dokinsa suka nutse a cikin kasa, sai ya fadi!"

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Suraqah gave up the chase. They asked him only to keep their secret, and went on their way."
msgstr "Suraqah ya daina binsu. Abin da kawai suka nema a gare shi shi ne ya boye asirinsu, sai suka ci gaba da tafiyarsu."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "At last they reached Madinah! The Prophet’s camel walked through the town and knelt in an open yard."
msgstr "A karshe sun isa Madinah! Rakumar Annabi ta ratsa ta cikin gari sannan ta durkusa a wani fili."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "That yard became the place of his mosque, and he carried bricks to help build it."
msgstr "Wannan fili ya zama wurin gina masallacinsa, kuma ya dauki bulo da kansa domin taimakawa wajen gina shi."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "One hot noon, the Prophet ﷺ came to Abu Bakr’s house with big news: it was time to go. Abu Bakr asked to come too, and he said yes."
msgstr "Wata rana da rana mai zafi, Annabi ﷺ ya zo gidan Abu Bakr da wani babban labari: lokacin tafiya ya yi. Abu Bakr ya nemi ya bi shi, sai ya amince."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Abu Bakr took all his money for the journey. His daughter Asma put stones in its place to comfort her grandfather, who could not see."
msgstr "Abu Bakr ya kwashe dukkan dukiyarsa domin tafiyar. Diyarsa Asma ta sanya duwatsu a madadin kudin domin ta kwantar da hankalin kakanta wanda ba ya gani."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Asma used her belt to tie up their food bag. People called her “the one with two belts”."
msgstr "Asma ta yi amfani da dambalinta (igiyar daure kugu) wajen daure buhun abincinsu. Mutane suka kira ta da \"Mai dambali biyu\" (Zatun Nitaqayn)."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "One report says the searchers saw a spider’s web across the cave and walked away."
msgstr "Wani rahoton ya ce masu neman nasu sun ga gizo-gizo ya saka a bakin kogon sai suka juya suka tafi."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Their guide knew the desert well. He led them along the coast, past many places whose names we still know."
msgstr "Jagoransu ya san sahara sosai. Ya bi da su ta hanyar teku, inda suka ratsa ta wurare da dama wadanda har yanzu muna sanin sunayensu."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "On the way, a friend called al-Zubayr gave them new white clothes."
msgstr "A kan hanya, wani aboki mai suna al-Zubayr ya ba su sabbin fararen tufafi."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "On his way into Madinah, the Prophet ﷺ led Friday prayer with about a hundred people."
msgstr "A kan hanyarsa ta shiga Madina, Annabi ﷺ ya jagoranci sallar Juma'a tare da mutane kusan dari."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Everyone wanted the Prophet ﷺ to stay with them. He said: let the camel go, she has been told where to stop."
msgstr "Kowa yana son Annabi ﷺ ya sauka a gidansa. Sai ya ce: ku kyale rakumar, domin an umarce ta da inda zata tsaya."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "He stayed in the house of Abu Ayyub until his mosque and his home were built."
msgstr "Ya zauna a gidan Abu Ayyub har sai da aka gina masallacinsa da gidansa."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "He made the people who arrived and the people of Madinah brothers, to help each other."
msgstr "Ya sanya mutanen da suka yi hijira da mutanen Madina su zama 'yan uwan juna, domin su taimaki juna."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Many people remember a happy song sung to welcome him, but we are not sure it was sung that day."
msgstr "Mutane da yawa suna tunawa da wata wakar farin ciki da aka rera domin yi masa maraba, amma ba mu da tabbas ko an rera ta a ranar."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The Hijrah is so central that the Islamic calendar counts its years from it."
msgstr "Hijrah tana da muhimmanci sosai har ta kai ga kalandar Musulunci tana kirga shekarunta ne daga gare ta."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Trust and careful planning sit side by side: the Prophet ﷺ relied on Allah and still prepared every step."
msgstr "Dogara ga Allah da tsari na gari suna tafiya ne tare: Annabi ﷺ ya dogara ga Allah kuma ya shirya dukkan mataki daki-daki."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Even with people plotting against him, he made sure their property was returned. His honesty did not depend on how he was treated."
msgstr "Ko da yake mutane suna kulla masa makirci, ya tabbatar da cewa an mayar musu da kayayyakinsu. Gaskiyarsa ba ta dogara da yadda ake mu'amalantar sa ba."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "In the most frightening moment, the lesson is calm trust: Allah is with us."
msgstr "A lokacin mafi ban tsoro, darasin shi ne natsuwa da dogara ga Allah: lallai Allah yana tare da mu."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Choosing an unexpected route was wisdom, not doubt. Muslims are taught to trust Allah and still take sensible steps."
msgstr "Zabar hanyar da ba a zato ba hikima ce, ba wai shakka ba. Ana koyar da Musulmai su dogara ga Allah kuma su dauki matakan da suka dace."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A man who set out to capture them left asking for their protection. The story is full of reversals like this."
msgstr "Wani mutum da ya fito domin ya kamo su, ya koma yana neman kariyarsu. Labarin yana cike da sauye-sauye irin wannan."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Hospitality from strangers, and blessing in very little, run through the whole of the Prophet’s life."
msgstr "Kyakkyawar karbar baki daga baki, da albarka a cikin abu kalilan, suna bayyana a daukacin rayuwar Annabi."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Short for “peace and blessings of Allah be upon him”, said by Muslims after the Prophet’s name."
msgstr "Gajeren rubutu na \"Tsira da amincin Allah su tabbata a gare shi\", wanda Musulmai ke fada bayan ambaton sunan Annabi."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Hijrah"
msgstr "Hijrah"

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The migration of the Prophet ﷺ and his companions from Makkah to Madinah, in 622."
msgstr "Hijirar Annabi ﷺ da sahabbansa daga Makkah zuwa Madinah, a shekara ta 622."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Quraysh"
msgstr "Quraysh"

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The leading tribe of Makkah. The Prophet ﷺ himself belonged to it."
msgstr "Babban kabilar Makkah. Annabi ﷺ da kansa yana daya daga cikinsu."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The city where the Prophet ﷺ was born, home of the Ka‘bah."
msgstr "Birnin da aka haifi Annabi ﷺ, kuma gidan Ka'abah."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Then called Yathrib: the city that welcomed the Prophet ﷺ. Its name means “the city”."
msgstr "Wanda a da ake kira Yathrib: birnin da ya karbi Annabi ﷺ. Sunansa yana nufin \"birnin\"."

