#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "Abu Bakr prepared two camels. Asma helped pack food for the journey."
msgstr "Abubakar ya shirya raƙuma biyu. Asma'u ta taimaka wajen haɗa guzurin tafiya."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "They chose a guide who knew the roads well. He would bring their camels after three nights."
msgstr "Sun zaɓi jagora wanda ya san hanyoyi sosai. Zai kawo musu raƙumansu bayan kwana uku."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "An early account tells how the leaders of Quraysh met in Makkah to plan against the Prophet ﷺ."
msgstr "Wani tsohon labari ya bayyana yadda shugabannin ƙuraishawa suka haɗu a Makka don ƙulla makirci ga Annabi ﷺ."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "The account says they waited outside his door that night, while ‘Ali slept in his bed, wrapped in his green cloak."
msgstr "Labarin ya ce sun jira a wajen ƙofarsa a wannan daren, yayin da Ali yake kwance a gadonsa, a lulluɓe da koren mayafinsa."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "After three nights, their guide brought the camels. They left the cave and travelled towards Madinah."
msgstr "Bayan kwana uku, jagoran nasu ya kawo raƙuman. Suka fita daga kogon suka nufi Madina."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "They took a route near the coast. The journey was long, with many stops along the way."
msgstr "Sun bi hanyar kusa da gaɓar teku. Tafiyar ta yi tsawo, tare da tsayawa a wurare da yawa a kan hanya."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "Another account describes a stop at Umm Ma‘bad’s tent. She had a thin sheep that was not giving milk."
msgstr "Wani labarin kuma ya bayyana tsayawarsu a tantin Ummu Ma'bad. Tana da wata siririyar tunkiya da ba ta ba da madara."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "It says the Prophet ﷺ prayed and milked the sheep, and there was milk for everyone."
msgstr "Ya ce Annabi ﷺ ya yi addu'a kuma ya tatsi tunkiyar, aka samu madara ga kowa da kowa."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "They first stopped at Quba, near Madinah, where a mosque was founded."
msgstr "Sun fara sauka a Quba, kusa da Madina, inda aka kafa masallaci."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "Madinah is to the north. They went south first, towards Mount Thawr."
msgstr "Madina tana wajen arewa ne. Da farko sun nufi kudu, zuwa dutsen Thawr."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "A mosque was founded at Quba, making worship a part of life in the new home."
msgstr "An kafa masallaci a Quba, wanda ya mai da bauta wani ɓangare na rayuwa a sabon gida."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "Madinah became a home for the growing Muslim community, bringing newcomers and their hosts together."
msgstr "Madina ta zama gida ga al'ummar musulmi da ke haɓaka, inda aka haɗa baƙi da masu masaukinsu wuri ɗaya."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "An eighth-century historian whose accounts of the Prophet’s life are preserved by later writers."
msgstr "Wani masanin tarihi na ƙarni na takwas wanda marubuta na gaba suka adana labaransa game da rayuwar Annabi."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "Mode changed. Your place is saved."
msgstr "An canza yanayi. An ajiye inda kake."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "‘Ali stayed behind to return the precious things that people had left with the Prophet ﷺ."
msgstr "‘Ali ya tsaya a baya domin ya mayar da kayayyaki masu daraja da mutane suka bari a wurin Annabi ﷺ."

#: src/lib/scene-manifest.js
msgid "E09"
msgstr "E09"

#: src/content/lenses.js
