#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "What’s inside"
msgstr "Abin da ke ciki"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "<0>Gathered from the sources.</0> Passages on the Hijrah were collected from the classical Arabic works on Turath, among them Ibn Hisham’s Sirah, Sahih al-Bukhari, Sahih Muslim, al-Bayhaqi’s Dala’il al-Nubuwwa and Ibn Kathir."
msgstr "<0>An tattaro daga madogara.</0> An tattaro nassoshi kan Hijira daga tsofaffin littattafan Turath na Larabci, ciki har da Sirar Ibn Hisham, Sahih al-Bukhari, Sahih Muslim, Dala’il al-Nubuwwa ta al-Bayhaqi da Ibn Kathir."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "<0>One Arabic core.</0> The events were set out as records and claims, each tied to the passages that support it. Everything the app says comes from this core."
msgstr "<0>Tushe guda na Larabci.</0> An tsara al'amuran a matsayin bayanai da ka'idoji, kowanne yana da alaka da nassin da ke goyon bayansa. Duk abin da manhajar ta kunsa ya samo asali ne daga wannan tushen."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "<0>Written in Arabic first.</0> Each reading was written in Arabic from the core, and the passages it shows are the exact source text, never retyped."
msgstr "<0>An fara rubuta shi da Larabci.</0> An rubuta kowane karatu da Larabci daga ainihin tushen, kuma nassoshin da ke ciki ainihin matanin madogara ne, ba a sake rubuta su ba."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "<0>Translated from the Arabic.</0> The other languages are translated directly from the Arabic, not through English."
msgstr "<0>An fassara daga Larabci.</0> Sauran harsunan an fassara su kai tsaye ne daga Larabci, ba ta hanyar Turanci ba."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "<0>Practice from the same evidence.</0> Questions are built on the same claims and passages, so every answer can be checked against its source."
msgstr "<0>Gwaji daga hujjoji guda.</0> An gina tambayoyi a kan bayanai da nassoshi iri daya, domin a iya duba kowace amsa daga asalin madogararta."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "<0>Drawn with care.</0> The terrain is real; places and routes are schematic. People are never shown, and animals appear without riders."
msgstr "<0>An zana da kulawa.</0> Yanayin kasa na hakika ne; wurare da hanyoyi zane ne kawai. Ba a nuna mutane ko kadan ba, kuma dabbobi na bayyana ba tare da mahaya ba."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "<0>AI, guided by the sources.</0> AI tools helped draft, translate and voice the narration, always working from the Arabic sources."
msgstr "<0>AI, tare da jagorar madogara.</0> Kayan aikin AI sun taimaka wajen tsarawa, fassara da muryar labarin, a kullum ana aiki ne daga madogaran Larabci."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "How it was made"
msgstr "Yadda aka yi shi"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "Reading mode selected. The same journey is available without narration."
msgstr "An zaɓi yanayin karatu. Ana iya bin tafiyar ba tare da sautin murya ba."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "Journey complete. Recap opened."
msgstr "Tafiya ta kammala. An buɗe taƙaitaccen bita."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "Where the journey begins, with preparations for departure."
msgstr "Inda tafiyar ta fara, tare da shirye-shiryen tashi."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "Where the journey closes, with arrival and a new beginning."
msgstr "Inda tafiyar ta ƙare, tare da isowa da sabon mafari."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "The offline journey notes do not establish an answer to that question."
msgstr "Bayanin tafiya na wajen layi bai kafa amsar wannan tambayar ba."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "That stage is not available."
msgstr "Wannan matakin ba ya samuwa."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "Chapters"
msgstr "Babi-babi"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "Each point of light is a passage this journey cites, placed where it speaks of. Select one to read it."
msgstr "Kowane ɗigon haske wani nassi ne da wannan tafiyar ta kawo, an sanya shi a inda yake magana a kai. Zaɓi ɗaya don karantawa."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "<0>Play</0> walks the journey stage by stage with AI-generated narration."
msgstr "<0>Kunna</0> yana bin tafiyar mataki-mataki tare da sautin murya na AI."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "<0>Play</0> walks the journey stage by stage. The captions keep time over a quiet wind."
msgstr "<0>Kunna</0> yana bin tafiyar mataki-mataki. Rubutun yana tafiya daidai da sauti cikin natsuwa."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "<0>Ask</0> uses the journey’s context to research in Turath and answer with source citations."
msgstr "<0>Tambaya</0> yana amfani da mahallin tafiyar don bincike a Turath tare da ba da amsa da nassosin tushe."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "Every paragraph rests on a passage from the classical Arabic sources, with a link to its page on Turath. The chapters go deeper into each part of the story, and the practice questions are drawn from the same passages."
msgstr "Kowane sakin layi ya dogara ne a kan nassi daga tsofaffin tushen Larabci, tare da mahaɗi zuwa shafinsa a Turath. Babi-babin suna yin zurfi a kowane sashe na labarin, kuma an ciro tambayoyin gwaji daga nassosin."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "<0>Chapters</0> that go deeper into each part of the story, each with its source passages."
msgstr "<0>Babi-babi</0> da ke yin zurfi a kowane sashe na labarin, kowannensu tare da nassosin tushensa."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "<0>Written in Arabic first.</0> Each chapter was written in Arabic from the core, and the passages it shows are the exact source text, never retyped."
msgstr "<0>An fara rubutawa da Larabci.</0> An rubuta kowane babi da Larabci tun daga tushe, kuma nassosin da yake nunawa ainihin rubutun asali ne, ba sake bugawa aka yi ba."

